        "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #610. Implemented iteration-timeout hardening by capturing runIterationPrompts() promise and attaching catch before Promise.race to prevent Node.js 22 unhandled rejection on timeout/dispose path. Added/confirmed @cli-ralph ac-24/ac-25/ac-26 for iteration-timeout defaults, validation, and iteration.timeout event behavior, with AC annotations in tests/ralph.test.ts. Verified @cli-ralph AC annotation coverage across ac-1..ac-26 and green PR CI on merge commit 3935ca808c131813871ec5a48e7550f9a239a5a1."
